\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n          <h2 class=\\\"text-lg font-semibold text-fuchsia-300\\\">Wolves of the East Ridge</h2>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-xs text-yellow-300\\\">In Progress</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-sm text-slate-400 mt-2\\\">Defeat 5 wolves guarding the ridge path.</p>\\n        <div class=\\\"mt-3 h-2 w-full rounded-full bg-slate-800 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"h-full w-1/2 bg-gradient-to-r from-rose-500 to-red-500\\\"></div>\\n        </div>\\n      </li>\\n\\n      <!-- Quest Item -->\\n      <li class=\\\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/40 p-5\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n          <h2 class=\\\"text-lg font-semibold text-emerald-300\\\">Echoes of the Ruins</h2>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400\\\">Not Started</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-sm text-slate-400 mt-2\\\">Explore the abandoned ruins and recover relics.</p>\\n        <div class=\\\"mt-3 h-2 w-full rounded-full bg-slate-800\\\"></div>\\n      </li>\\n    </ul>\\n  </section>\\n\\n</body>\\n</html>\" }} />\n  );\n}\n",
      "type": "registry:ui"
